# =============================================================================
# AquaCast — optional environment configuration
# =============================================================================
#
# The application runs with NONE of these set. Every variable below is an
# optional upgrade: unset it and the corresponding feature falls back to a
# local, clearly-labelled simulation.
#
# To use any of them:
#     cp .env.example .env      # then edit
#
# Nothing here is required. `streamlit run app.py` works with an empty
# environment, no network access, and no credentials of any kind.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Language model — optional narration layer
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used ONLY by src/advisor.py :: llm_narrate() to re-phrase recommendations in
# the farmer's language. It never originates advice, and the deterministic
# engine is complete without it. When unset, the UI states plainly that the
# layer is off rather than faking a response.
#
# AQUACAST_LLM_KEY=sk-...
# AQUACAST_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Satellite imagery — Google Earth Engine
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production: Sentinel-2 surface reflectance (COPERNICUS/S2_SR_HARMONIZED),
# 10 m, 5-day revisit, cloud-masked, to replace the phenology model in
# src/satellite.py :: field_timeseries().
#
# When unset, the app uses a double-logistic phenology curve anchored to PAU
# crop-calendar dates and labels it "Simulated" wherever it appears.
#
# AQUACAST_GEE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=/path/to/service-account.json
# AQUACAST_GEE_PROJECT=your-gcp-project

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Spatial database — PostgreSQL + PostGIS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production: district boundaries, well networks and lithologs served from
# PostGIS. When unset, the same layers load from GeoJSON in data/.
#
# AQUACAST_DB_DSN=postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/aquacast

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Message delivery — Twilio / WhatsApp Business
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production: WhatsApp Business API template messages with delivery receipts,
# Twilio SMS fallback for feature phones, and Punjabi IVR voice.
#
# When unset, no message is sent anywhere. The Farmer Phone dashboard renders
# the message on a simulated handset and stages it locally.
#
# AQUACAST_TWILIO_SID=
# AQUACAST_TWILIO_TOKEN=
# AQUACAST_WHATSAPP_FROM=whatsapp:+14155238886

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lender integration — KYC, credit bureau, loan origination
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production: bureau pulls, KYC verification, and origination against the
# lender's own systems.
#
# NOT IMPLEMENTED IN ANY FORM, KEY OR NO KEY. This prototype performs no
# identity check, no bureau enquiry and no credit sanction. The credit score
# shown is a deterministic model on public district priors and is labelled
# "illustrative — not an offer of credit" everywhere it appears.
#
# AQUACAST_LENDER_API_URL=
# AQUACAST_LENDER_API_KEY=

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Carbon registry
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production: registration under an approved methodology, validation by an
# accredited VVB, and issuance against a registry.
#
# NOT IMPLEMENTED. No credit is issued, registered or sold anywhere in this
# prototype. Carbon figures are estimates carrying a stated haircut.
#
# AQUACAST_REGISTRY_URL=
# AQUACAST_REGISTRY_KEY=
